  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Zones v3.0",
    "description": "The GRID3 COD - Health Zones v3.0 dataset consists of health zone boundaries with name, location, and other related attributes for thirteen provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD): Province group 1: Haut-Katanga, Kasaï, Kasaï-Oriental, Kinshasa, and Lomami Province group 2: Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika Province group 3: Ituri and Kwilu Province group 4: Maniema Province group 5: Kasaï-Central Province group 6: Tshopo and Mongala This operational dataset has not been fully validated by government officials or ministries. This data release supersedes the GRID3 COD - Health Zones v2.0 at https://doi.org/10.7916/jqb0-8c67. The following changes were made: - Tshopo and Mongala Provinces have been added. Keywords: Health Zones",
    "license": "The data and accompanying document are licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International, CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0) and specified in legal code (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode).",
